\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d57fb629 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"d57fb629\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3ff8ef68 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\" data-id=\"3ff8ef68\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"html.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<style>.d01-fpage{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:48px 32px 32px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:64px;}.d01-fgroup{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 2.4fr;gap:48px;align-items:start;border-top:1px solid rgba(10,14,21,0.13);padding-top:32px;}.d01-fgroup-head{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;position:sticky;top:120px;}.d01-fgroup-id{font-family:\"JetBrains Mono\",ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:11px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5B6470;}.d01-fgroup-id b{color:#0F8A5F;font-weight:500;}.d01-fgroup-name{font-family:\"Geist\",sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(28px,3.4vw,44px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#0A0E15;margin:0;}.d01-fgroup-name em{font-family:\"Newsreader\",Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;color:#5B6470;}.d01-fgroup-blurb{font-family:\"Geist\",sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:#5B6470;margin:8px 0 0;max-width:32ch;}.d01-fcards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:0;border:1px solid rgba(10,14,21,0.13);}.d01-fcard{padding:28px 24px;border-right:1px solid rgba(10,14,21,0.13);background:#FAF7EC;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;min-height:240px;}.d01-fcard:nth-child(3n){border-right:0;}.d01-fcard:nth-child(n+4){border-top:1px solid rgba(10,14,21,0.13);}.d01-fcard-id{font-family:\"JetBrains Mono\",ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:10px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5B6470;}.d01-fcard-title{font-family:\"Geist\",sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#0A0E15;margin:0;}.d01-fcard-desc{font-family:\"Geist\",sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:#5B6470;margin:0;}.d01-fcard-tag{align-self:flex-start;font-family:\"JetBrains Mono\",ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:9px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5B6470;border:1px solid rgba(10,14,21,0.13);padding:4px 8px;margin-top:auto;}@media(max-width:1100px){.d01-fgroup{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:24px;}.d01-fgroup-head{position:static;}}@media(max-width:900px){.d01-fcards{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.d01-fcard{border-right:0 !important;border-top:1px solid rgba(10,14,21,0.13);min-height:auto;}.d01-fcard:first-child{border-top:0;}.d01-fpage{padding:32px 20px;gap:40px;}}@media(max-width:1100px) and (min-width:901px){.d01-fcards{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}.d01-fcard{border-right:1px solid rgba(10,14,21,0.13) !important;border-top:1px solid rgba(10,14,21,0.13);}.d01-fcard:first-child,.d01-fcard:nth-child(2){border-top:0;}.d01-fcard:nth-child(2n){border-right:0 !important;}}.d01-fcta{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:32px 32px 80px;}.d01-fcta-inner{border:1px solid rgba(10,14,21,0.13);background:#FAF7EC;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr;gap:48px;padding:48px;align-items:center;}.d01-fcta-kicker{font-family:\"JetBrains Mono\",ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:11px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5B6470;margin-bottom:16px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;}.d01-fcta-kicker::before{content:\"\";display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#0F8A5F;}.d01-fcta-headline{font-family:\"Geist\",sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(28px,3.4vw,44px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#0A0E15;margin:0;}.d01-fcta-headline em{font-family:\"Newsreader\",Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;color:#5B6470;}.d01-fcta-actions{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;}.d01-fcta-actions a{font-family:\"JetBrains Mono\",ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:11px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:1.6px;text-transform:uppercase;padding:14px 24px;text-decoration:none;border:1px solid #0A0E15;transition:background .15s,color .15s,border-color .15s;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;}.d01-fcta-primary{background:#0F8A5F;border-color:#0F8A5F;color:#FAF7EC;}.d01-fcta-primary:hover{background:#0A0E15;border-color:#0A0E15;}.d01-fcta-secondary{background:transparent;color:#0A0E15;border-color:rgba(10,14,21,0.20);}.d01-fcta-secondary:hover{border-color:#0A0E15;}@media(max-width:800px){.d01-fcta-inner{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:32px 24px;gap:32px;}.d01-fcta{padding:24px 20px 48px;}}</style><div class=\"d01-fpage\"><section class=\"d01-fgroup\"><div class=\"d01-fgroup-head\"><span class=\"d01-fgroup-id\"><b>01</b> · 能力组</span><h2 class=\"d01-fgroup-name\">二维码<em>管理。</em></h2><p class=\"d01-fgroup-blurb\">把基础功能做到位：可编辑的代码、智能跳转、批量生成。印一次，永久复用。</p></div><div class=\"d01-fcards\"><article class=\"d01-fcard\"><span class=\"d01-fcard-id\">01 · 可编辑</span><h3 class=\"d01-fcard-title\">动态二维码</h3><p class=\"d01-fcard-desc\">随时更新目标地址，无需重新打印。更换网址、切换落地页、推送新优惠——已印刷的代码永不改变。</p><span class=\"d01-fcard-tag\">编辑 · 版本</span></article><article class=\"d01-fcard\"><span class=\"d01-fcard-id\">02 · 路由</span><h3 class=\"d01-fcard-title\">智能跳转</h3><p class=\"d01-fcard-desc\">按设备类型、浏览器、操作系统、语言或自定义规则路由。把 iOS 用户导向 App Store，Android 导向 Google Play，其余导向兜底页。</p><span class=\"d01-fcard-tag\">设备 · 规则</span></article><article class=\"d01-fcard\"><span class=\"d01-fcard-id\">03 · 批量</span><h3 class=\"d01-fcard-title\">批量生成</h3><p class=\"d01-fcard-desc\">从一个 CSV 生成数百个唯一代码。专为产品包装、多门店活动和大型活动部署而打造。</p><span class=\"d01-fcard-tag\">CSV · 规模化</span></article></div></section><section class=\"d01-fgroup\"><div class=\"d01-fgroup-head\"><span class=\"d01-fgroup-id\"><b>02</b> · 能力组</span><h2 class=\"d01-fgroup-name\">位置<em>智能。</em></h2><p class=\"d01-fgroup-blurb\">GPS 地理围栏让同一个代码在每个地方都变成不同的代码。定义区域、按地区路由、投放本地内容。</p></div><div class=\"d01-fcards\"><article class=\"d01-fcard\"><span class=\"d01-fcard-id\">04 · 地理围栏</span><h3 class=\"d01-fcard-title\">GPS 地理围栏</h3><p class=\"d01-fcard-desc\">按半径或多边形定义虚拟边界。扫描发生在区域内或区域外时采用不同路由，精度达米级。</p><span class=\"d01-fcard-tag\">半径 · 多边形</span></article><article class=\"d01-fcard\"><span class=\"d01-fcard-id\">05 · 本地</span><h3 class=\"d01-fcard-title\">基于位置的内容</h3><p class=\"d01-fcard-desc\">展示附近门店、本地定价、区域优惠、语言匹配的落地页。同一个代码，实时本地化。</p><span class=\"d01-fcard-tag\">个性化</span></article><article class=\"d01-fcard\"><span class=\"d01-fcard-id\">06 · 多点</span><h3 class=\"d01-fcard-title\">多门店路由</h3><p class=\"d01-fcard-desc\">每家加盟店一个代码，零额外开销。自动将每个扫描位置映射到正确目的地；集中统一管理。</p><span class=\"d01-fcard-tag\">加盟 · 连锁</span></article></div></section><section class=\"d01-fgroup\"><div class=\"d01-fgroup-head\"><span class=\"d01-fgroup-id\"><b>03</b> · 能力组</span><h2 class=\"d01-fgroup-name\">时间<em>路由。</em></h2><p class=\"d01-fgroup-blurb\">一天中的时段、一周中的某天、日历日期。行为按计划自动变化，无需人工介入。</p></div><div class=\"d01-fcards\"><article class=\"d01-fcard\"><span class=\"d01-fcard-id\">07 · 时段</span><h3 class=\"d01-fcard-title\">基于时间的路由</h3><p class=\"d01-fcard-desc\">按小时、日期或日期范围指向不同目的地。11 点前为早午餐菜单，17 点后为晚餐，周六有特惠。</p><span class=\"d01-fcard-tag\">时段 · 日期</span></article><article class=\"d01-fcard\"><span class=\"d01-fcard-id\">08 · 实时</span><h3 class=\"d01-fcard-title\">即时更新</h3><p class=\"d01-fcard-desc\">变更在亚秒级生效。无需刷新 CDN、无需重建、无需等待。推送变更，下一次扫描即刻生效。</p><span class=\"d01-fcard-tag\">亚秒级</span></article><article class=\"d01-fcard\"><span class=\"d01-fcard-id\">09 · 排期</span><h3 class=\"d01-fcard-title\">活动排期</h3><p class=\"d01-fcard-desc\">为任意代码设置开始和结束日期。周一上午 9 点启动活动，周日午夜自动下线——无需手动切换。</p><span class=\"d01-fcard-tag\">自动 · 日历</span></article></div></section><section class=\"d01-fgroup\"><div class=\"d01-fgroup-head\"><span class=\"d01-fgroup-id\"><b>04</b> · 能力组</span><h2 class=\"d01-fgroup-name\">分析<em>与团队。</em></h2><p class=\"d01-fgroup-blurb\">实时智能、按角色划分的协作、移动优先的交付。像管理其余技术栈一样运营它。</p></div><div class=\"d01-fcards\"><article class=\"d01-fcard\"><span class=\"d01-fcard-id\">10 · 洞察</span><h3 class=\"d01-fcard-title\">高级分析</h3><p class=\"d01-fcard-desc\">实时扫描追踪，涵盖位置、设备、浏览器、时间和转化智能。热力图、漏斗、导出、集成一应俱全。</p><span class=\"d01-fcard-tag\">地理 · 漏斗 · 导出</span></article><article class=\"d01-fcard\"><span class=\"d01-fcard-id\">11 · 团队</span><h3 class=\"d01-fcard-title\">团队协作</h3><p class=\"d01-fcard-desc\">邀请队友并赋予按角色划分的权限。活动日志、审批流程，面向代理机构和加盟体系的多租户支持。</p><span class=\"d01-fcard-tag\">角色 · 审计</span></article><article class=\"d01-fcard\"><span class=\"d01-fcard-id\">12 · 移动</span><h3 class=\"d01-fcard-title\">移动端优化</h3><p class=\"d01-fcard-desc\">智能设备检测、响应式落地页、快速首屏渲染。在 iOS、Android 及其余平台上都完美运行。</p><span class=\"d01-fcard-tag\">iOS · Android</span></article></div></section></div><section class=\"d01-fcta\"><div class=\"d01-fcta-inner\"><div><span class=\"d01-fcta-kicker\">D01 / READY</span><h2 class=\"d01-fcta-headline\">十二项功能。<em>一个可编辑的代码。</em></h2></div><div class=\"d01-fcta-actions\"><a class=\"d01-fcta-primary\" href=\"https://app.scanfence.com/signup\">开始免费试用</a><a class=\"d01-fcta-secondary\" href=\"/contact/\">联系销售</a></div></div></section>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t",
